# FE Docs and Status Rule

Treat `woodcert-auction-fe/docs/` as the documentation source of truth.

## When code or architecture changes

- Update the relevant doc in `docs/`.
- Update `docs/PROJECT-STATUS.md`.
- If stack or architecture baseline changes, add or update an ADR in `docs/decisions/`.

## Do not

- Do not change architecture behavior without reconciling the docs.
- Do not add new project-wide patterns silently.
- Do not leave prompts, rules, and docs in conflict.
